ULLIS(1)                         User Commands                        ULLIS(1)

NAME
       ullis - train RWKV-8 Heron / ROSA language models on Apple Silicon

SYNOPSIS
       ullis --smoke
       ullis train --data DATASET --run DIRECTORY [OPTIONS]
       ullis tokenize --data INPUT --output OUTPUT
       ullis inspect --run DIRECTORY
       ullis generate --checkpoint CHECKPOINT --prompt TEXT [--max-tokens N]
       ullis chat --checkpoint CHECKPOINT [--session FILE] [--thinking LEVEL]
       ullis eval-digits --checkpoint CHECKPOINT --task reverse|plusminus [--max-digits N]

DESCRIPTION
       Metal is the default training backend and requires macOS on Apple Silicon. CPU is --backend cpu (numerical checks and hybrid digit eval).

       Default architecture is heron (ROSA-QKV-1bit + CMix x070). 1-bit names the ROSA alphabet, not the weights: unmatched and matched-0 map to -e, matched-1 to +e. There is no 4-bit profile in 0.10.

       A training directory contains config.json, tokenizer.json, metrics.jsonl, and checkpoint.json (format_version 2: packed bits, scales, bias, FP16 tensors that are officially float; no BinaryConnect latents). Hyena v1 checkpoints cannot be resumed.

       Progress reports raw next-token loss and an EMA. Default train uses stop_grad_bits (frozen QKV) and stateless clipped SGD. Admission budget is 4 GiB; do not set --memory-budget-mib 8192 on an 8 GiB Mac.

TRAIN
       ullis train --data dataset.jsonl --run runs/first --config train_config.json --steps 1000

       --config FILE             JSON or TOML TrainConfig. The repo default is train_config.json (not config.toml).
       --architecture heron|rosa-rwkv7
                                 Default heron. rosa-rwkv7 train is not wired; use it for eval-digits / generate.
       --d-model N               Override model width.
       --layers N                Override number of Heron (or hybrid) blocks.
       --context-len N           Override training context; never silently capped. Hybrid requires a multiple of 16 (not 129).
       --batch-size N            Override batch size.
       --vocab-size N            BPE vocabulary ceiling (heron: at least 260).
       --seed N                  Override initialization/BPE seed.
       --memory-budget-mib N     Override hard allocation budget. Default profile is 4096 MiB.
       --optimizer stateless-sgd|lion-fp16
                                 Default stateless-sgd. lion-fp16 is optional on FP16 tensors.
       --resume CHECKPOINT       Restore v2 checkpoint.json and matching tokenizer.json. v1 is a hard error. Overrides cannot change architecture/shapes.
       --steps N                 New optimization steps. Default: 1.
       --learning-rate RATE      Positive stateless-SGD rate. Default: 1e-3.
       --checkpoint-every N      Save every N steps and at completion. Default: 100.
       --backend metal|cpu       Default: metal.

TOKENIZE
       ullis tokenize --data raw.jsonl --output normalized.jsonl

       Validates and rewrites normalized JSONL before a long run.

INSPECT
       ullis inspect --run runs/first

       Prints architecture, param split, checkpoint version, and generate-time SAM / time-shift sizes.

GENERATE
       ullis generate --checkpoint runs/first/checkpoint.json --prompt 'Hello' --max-tokens 64

       Loads tokenizer.json next to the checkpoint. Greedy t+1 decode with the same RosaSam::push used in train (incremental, not full recompute). Correctness decoder, not a sampling server.

CHAT
       ullis chat --checkpoint runs/first/checkpoint.json --session sessions/first.jsonl --thinking high

       Line-oriented loop. Commands: /think low|medium|high|xhigh|off, /save, /quit. User and assistant records are JSONL. Thinking level is prompt policy metadata; it does not impose a separate inference-time compute budget.

EVAL-DIGITS
       ullis eval-digits --checkpoint FILE --task reverse|plusminus [--max-digits 8]

       Requires a rosa_rwkv7 checkpoint. reverse: V=12 {0-9, ',', '#'}, pad '#' to T_wkv=144 (or 272). plusminus: V=13 {0-9, '+', '-', '='}, pad '=' to 144. Accuracy is the unpadded span (p1/p2), not the WKV pad tail. Not a 90% release gate.

DATA FORMAT
       One JSON object per line:

       {"id":"demo-1","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"Be concise."},{"role":"user","content":"What is 2+2?"},{"role":"assistant","thinking":"Use arithmetic.","content":"4"}],"metadata":{"split":"train"}}

       Allowed roles: system, user, assistant, tool. Every assistant message requires a non-empty thinking field. Tool messages require tool_call_id. Optional assistant tool_calls have {id, name, arguments}; this reserves the future agent-trace schema but does not execute tools.

FILES
       train_config.json           Default M1 8 GiB Heron profile (D=256, L=6, T=2048, 4 GiB budget).
       data/ullis_dataset.jsonl    Example JSONL corpus.

EXIT STATUS
       0      Command completed successfully.
       non-0  Invalid dataset/configuration, v1 checkpoint, unavailable Metal device, or I/O failure.
